Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a great voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Oozora Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Manaka Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you too, Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's the rebirth of a sensation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make the most of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Something coming to life from our imagination
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A one of a kind sensation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll become a brand-new me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and devote everything to what I love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you a present facing the future
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For now and forever, our hearts will shine brighter than the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget it! (Start dash!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's the rebirth of a sensation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make the most of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the start line!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see a brand-new sky
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fun is just beyond the horizon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The start of a dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and the start of a miracle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are waiting for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now wait a second-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now why the heck are there two of you singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't this supposed to be a solo performance?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that girl next to Laala-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's an amazing singer and dancer!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This was supposed to be an Akari solo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that cute little girl next to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, now that I'm lo around, I see a lot of unfamiliar faces...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not really sure how it happened, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu, Ai-katsu, Ai-katsu, Ai-katsu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Oozora Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a third year at the Starlight Academy middle school!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our school's holding an event today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,a big idol meetup!/get-together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's Starlight Academy's festival day!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kokone, Miyabi, and Niina showed up as our special guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almsot time for the performance to start!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're up first, Akari. Give them a performance to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can bet we'll be cheering you on from the audience!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Manaka Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Primary school 6th year!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we're having the "long time, no pri"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Parajuku Special Concert event!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tricolore's coming to be our special guests!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost concert time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're first up to pri today, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Being quick and decisive is the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them fired up with a great show!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please scan the necessary amount of PriTickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-what the heck is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno! I've never seen this place before!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait a sec, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you an idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you an idol, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to be putting on a concert here...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! I was, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Start Dash Sensation...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! That's the song I was supposed to sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a great song!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, would you like to perform together?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a great voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Oozora Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Manaka Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Excited to go on with you, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Same with you, Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how it all happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We just kinda ended up singing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"We just kinda ended up up singing together!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What, is this normal to you-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That certainly sounds like something Akari would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just where in the world are we...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Headmistress Orihime, Mr. Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You lot certainly aren't Starlight Academy students.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm from Paprika Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"Paprika"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I never heard of any schools with that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is PriPara, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"PriPara"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You've never heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara is an idol theme park where any girl can be an idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When we enter with our PriTickets, everyone becomes an idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Any girl can be an idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol park called PriPara?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm! How [fresh? idk]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess you guys can perform without going to PriPara, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Starlight Academy is dedicated to [raising?] idols
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,so we take lessons, go on the Starlight Stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and sometimes we get to do idol work outside school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are our idol activities, aka idol katsudou!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We call them "Aikatsu"!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"Idol katsudou"; Aikatsu for short!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A school dedicated to idoling...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So you guys have a school that's just about idols?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds so banger!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to keep up with our regular studies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara and Starlight Academy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Two places have become one...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that's something I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Meganii, PriPara's operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Meganee, PriPara's other operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're from Starlight Academy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,yet your stage changed upon going to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe the system did some sort of spatial transferrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean that Aikatsu system did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran a scan of the facility earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and a bug was detected in the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a glitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk to you two about your circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Both machines malfunctioning at the same time caused a rift in time and space.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Two worlds that were never supposed to overlap merged together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And in that rift, it would seem a special kind of place was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A rift containing two worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we stuck here-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, the gates to both PriPara and Starlight Academy's worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,haven't disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're able to come and go quite freely. I believe this is an entirely new area altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A brand-new area!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of idols could gather here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You could say it's an idol paradise!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do about the shows scheduled after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the question... Everyone was looking forward to those.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,May I offer my opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The floor is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. We'll meet in the room over there. Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, they'll be a while, so feel free to talk amongst yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna hear all about Starlight Academy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'd love to learn all about PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Shinjou Hinaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pop fit slays!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Mirei! With a pop and a step, I've gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bangs and hairclip are just adorbs-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Hikami Sumire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dancing freely on stage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The red rose of passion,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurebayashi Juri!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Always in top form
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and ready to strike first!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Toudou Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mucho gusto! Or should I say, pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go. Well met.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Are you two twins?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are so lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are pretty cute, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're nothing compared to me and Reona.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Dorothy! That's rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the girl who dances like lightning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurosawa Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm Amahane Madoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Super cool to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess they're not too shabby...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so many girls here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty of demonic servants to be found!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so fun-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So freakin' cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really great with goats!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my friend, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the cheerful idol,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Doujima Niina!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them are the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange place...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the system!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara ding-dong...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We have an announcement regarding the status of the performances
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,please gather around the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come to a decision regarding the planned shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Though things may have started off with some unexpected issues,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it's wonderful that idols from two different idol agencies,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Starlight Academy and PriPara,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,could meet and form bonds with one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we've decided hold a joint [dunno what to do with live fest]
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Singing, dancing, and freedom, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring along whoever you want to sing with you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and give everyone a performance to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we can directly transmit any song into your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,so no need to worry if you don't already know the lyrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hop to it! The early bird gets the worm!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's going to be our first singer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The idol of all idols;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,in other words, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The center of the universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kokoneー
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be the most charming person in the whole world first, don'tcha think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there! You can't just interrupt me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyabi and I were going to sing first!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I already called dibs!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nom me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite enough, Kokone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a little selfish of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree. You're causing quite a fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Such grace and insight...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a martial artist?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know some Naginata.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see such an extraordinary skill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us do battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I would love to engage you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's take this elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of couirse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Sion? We got a performance to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyabi, what about singing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How about the two of us go then-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams times effort, multiplied by friendship times friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's marble mix it up! Off to paradise, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't even know the rules
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A miracle that'll make you do a double-take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a couple of mixed up idols
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and a dream of Divine idolhood!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,An unstoppable beat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not quite natural
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but not quite dolled up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get a little girly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wearing a smile on our eyelids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,po-po-n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,On my way to a brand new me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams times effort
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume change!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams times effort
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our voices multiplied by never giving up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart-pounding and thrilling, time to marble mix it uo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not alone 'cause I'm with you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just anybody, it's you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A mysteriously magical future paradox!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Marble!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lovely show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You two totally killed it up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'd like to give performing a try, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The stage is all yours. Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet everyone would love to hear your rendition of Tutu Ballerina!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of song is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a super aloof but stylish song!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want someone who can pull off the whole icy cold vibe, then look no further than Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pshuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She seemed pretty amicable to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Aroma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thou art demon kin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldst thou join us in subjugating this realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use hiding. Thy cards give thee away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thy art a vampire, predicting armageddon with thy cursed cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the designers could be a little demonic...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You do also enjoy fortune telling...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us and subjugate the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the offer, but I'd like to just perform...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's out of control-pri...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say this calls for a Red Flash-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A pickled plum?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you prepared, my little cagebirds?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us make for the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.91,0:23:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.87,0:23:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyabi, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we could sing together...
Comment: 0,0:23:15.25,0:23:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.75,0:23:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Those look like they're made out of super delicious candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks so cute but so munchable-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.80,0:23:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's lot of sweets in the lyrics, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.30,0:23:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet the clothes and the song taste amazing-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.22,0:23:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna sing my heart out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about we sing together!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.58,0:24:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, lemme sing with ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.30,0:24:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and sunny sweets, the occasional chocolate
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.01,0:24:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a bit of the decorations and you'll be delighted
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.68,0:24:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret, but the girls know it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.02,0:24:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweets are happy clothes, wouldn't you say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.82,0:24:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(Mysterious) A pleasant flavor
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.82,0:24:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,(Special) Gentle and happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.08,0:24:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A little sweet magic's gonna make your heart skip a beat
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.04,0:24:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Caramelizing your heart kinda like having your first crush
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.92,0:24:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pastel colored macarons that make you dance with delight
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.76,0:24:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.43,0:24:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then your cheeks, ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.14,0:25:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The joy spreading through your heart like souffle chiffon
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.90,0:25:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The power to make everyone become friends
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.78,0:25:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So wonderful. ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.57,0:25:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart-pounding, ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.93,0:25:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A sweet tale
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.85,0:25:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How long're you gonna do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.89,0:25:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody keeps beating us to the punch!
Comment: 0,0:25:42.19,0:25:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:25:45.61,0:25:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.44,0:25:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Say,
Comment: 0,0:25:47.61,0:25:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.15,0:25:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to sing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.28,0:25:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nono!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.99,0:25:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Risa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.72,0:26:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.93,0:26:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A brand new day has dawned
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.56,0:26:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, lay hee! It's time to wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.02,0:26:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Over all the hills and even through the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.24,0:26:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a deep breath and relax
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.24,0:26:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Give all your worries the flick
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.54,0:26:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,(Gently, softly)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.25,0:26:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and leave them out to air atop a tree
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.42,0:26:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and bid them goodbye, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.96,0:26:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Lively, energetic and full of life
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.55,0:26:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy as happy can be, we sing gently with a ho ho ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.30,0:26:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And friendly,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.59,0:26:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,as close as two friends can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.52,0:27:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So come join this song, lay hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.81,0:27:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey little goat! (Baa baa baa) Hey little bird! (Tweet tweet tweet)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.39,0:27:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume change!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.94,0:27:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey little pig! (oink oink oink) Hey, horses and cows! (Neigh, moo)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.53,0:27:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey little frog! (Ribbit ribbit) Hey little duck! (quack quack)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.11,0:27:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And hello to you, too! (heigh ho!) Come join us, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.57,0:27:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lively, energetic and full of life
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.24,0:27:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy as happy can be, we sing gently with a ho ho ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.04,0:27:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And friendly,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.33,0:27:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,as close as two friends can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.85,0:27:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come join this song, lay hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.77,0:27:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up your feet, raise your voice, and come join this song, lay hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.23,0:27:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.65,0:27:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,for me
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.24,0:28:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,to make my appearance!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.41,0:28:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Gracias...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.95,0:28:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.20,0:28:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.50,0:28:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,De nada, señorita
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.17,0:28:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're most welcome, mademoiselle.
Comment: 0,0:28:30.94,0:28:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.19,0:28:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you rise with me
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.82,0:28:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,to zeal's stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.78,0:28:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You've the scent of a prodigy,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.07,0:28:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and even better,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.24,0:28:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't have one of those preposterous sentence-enders.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.28,0:28:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.08,0:28:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.66,0:28:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The blazing flame of revolution
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.22,0:29:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,ignited by the Shikyouin Hibiki!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.23,0:29:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You there, within that powerful yet weak-willed heart of yours,
Comment: 0,0:29:13.36,0:29:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.53,0:29:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,find yourself spurred by revolution
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.78,0:29:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You there, heed now the future assured by my unerring nobility
Comment: 0,0:29:26.99,0:29:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.37,0:29:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And leave the past behind
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.75,0:29:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Unsuited to such things as ladylike apparel or lipstick
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.05,0:29:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I am envied by god and mortal alike,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.64,0:29:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,for I am a Perfect Knight of Beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.60,0:29:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pure Amore Love
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.14,0:29:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it bloom ever magnificently
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.07,0:29:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A casablanca bursting open like raging magma
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.65,0:30:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Amore, come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.07,0:30:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall tell you now the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.41,0:30:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What is “love”?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.49,0:30:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Love is merely a fantasy for fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.58,0:30:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet it is by the whims of love
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.92,0:30:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that we two have been drawn here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.88,0:30:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.34,0:30:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Amore, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.59,0:30:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Avert not your eyes from the flower;
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.22,0:30:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,its hue rivaling any shade of crimson
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.18,0:30:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This pristine frenzy is for you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.23,0:30:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it’s for the sake of love
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.49,0:30:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and these dreams that “I” am here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.20,0:30:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Juri, you were amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.45,0:30:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But what should we do...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.67,0:30:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Vanilla Chili Pepper's song is meant for three people...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.96,0:31:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That footwork...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.10,0:31:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Her swordsmanship is amazing, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.94,0:31:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That was an excellent rehearsal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.98,0:31:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my sincerest gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.23,0:31:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.74,0:31:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look forward to facing off with you one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.15,0:31:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.70,0:31:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to perform with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.87,0:31:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Opportunity only knocks once.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.70,0:31:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be glad to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.26,0:31:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren'tcha forgetting someone over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.31,0:31:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, haa..
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.39,0:31:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, haa..
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.65,0:32:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, haa..
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.78,0:32:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dancing to the sun's rhythm, we dance and sing "Ole"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.91,0:32:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Different rhythmic stomps join together in unison
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.04,0:32:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's got things they love and things they don't
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.68,0:32:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No two people in the world are exactly alike, turning like the colors in a kaleidoscope
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.89,0:32:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come here
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.97,0:32:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and feel, feel, feel the energy
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.97,0:32:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make a move
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.98,0:32:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Give into the impulse and clap, clap, clap your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.81,0:32:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,one, two, three
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.77,0:32:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Step, step, step let it resonate
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.40,0:32:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our miracle is just beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.74,0:32:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams and aspirations are one in the same
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.83,0:33:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,giving birth to a neww dream
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.29,0:33:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dance to your heart's content, chicas
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.71,0:33:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Our future is right around the corner
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.17,0:33:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now no one knows
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.93,0:33:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the sound of a melody yet to be heard
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.64,0:33:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But when we dance together,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.73,0:33:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,we can bring to future to us
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.77,0:33:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, ah..
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.78,0:33:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, ah..
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.86,0:33:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, ah..
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.32,0:33:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, ah..
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.74,0:33:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.16,0:33:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Reona and I are definitely going next, or you're gonna hear it from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.79,0:33:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.34,0:33:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara ding-dong...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.26,0:33:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about 6 PM. The area will soon be closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.34,0:33:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.30,0:33:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We agreed upon doing things by the PriPara system's rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.68,0:33:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so no one is permitted to be here past 6 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.73,0:34:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We hate to disappoint everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.64,0:34:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over already...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.52,0:34:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wanted to sing more...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.36,0:34:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But in better news,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.36,0:34:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,whenever you visit this space,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.49,0:34:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,it may very well be possible to vist each other's worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.28,0:34:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This how we found each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.12,0:34:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so let's take the time to get to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.83,0:34:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.62,0:34:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.13,0:34:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can put on even more joint shows tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.05,0:34:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,See you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.39,0:34:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.01,0:34:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.60,0:34:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.06,0:34:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a good day-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.60,0:34:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You all too!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.06,0:34:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.07,0:34:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking forward to tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.53,0:34:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, see you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.82,0:34:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.75,0:35:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right back at'cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.50,0:35:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.46,0:35:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My dorm
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.30,0:35:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,is usually here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.51,0:35:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.22,0:35:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.60,0:35:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumire, Hinaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.19,0:35:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen what they're saying online?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.40,0:35:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"The celebrity idol, Hoshimiya Ichigo
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.53,0:35:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,changed her name to Hoshimiya Pineapple"...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.45,0:35:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Pineapple?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.16,0:35:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that it's not cute, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.24,0:35:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't picture that!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.95,0:35:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up in the news...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.54,0:35:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The idol group, Dancing Divas, have just announced they'll be disbanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.42,0:35:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They've said they'll be debuting as a group of treasure hunters from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.38,0:35:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.88,0:35:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not an actress in Aikatsu Teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.30,0:36:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but It's not a school teacher, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.02,0:36:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm a stageplay teacher?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.98,0:36:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.65,0:36:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my house, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.57,0:36:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is supposed to be an Italian restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.20,0:36:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh Big Sis, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.87,0:36:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Non!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.24,0:36:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.66,0:36:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.87,0:36:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.58,0:36:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But, you called me "big sis"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.00,0:36:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,so you must be Non, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.54,0:36:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.46,0:36:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really me. Your brother, Nonsuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.68,0:36:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nonsuke"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.06,0:36:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where did all these animals come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.52,0:36:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they're the mascots?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.40,0:36:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.19,0:37:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Our monja sign changed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.78,0:37:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's it "Monja Ninja" instead of "Ninja Monja"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.50,0:37:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's not that different...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.50,0:37:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.21,0:37:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.67,0:37:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something weird about the real world!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.01,0:37:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys had weird thing happen, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.18,0:37:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.89,0:37:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like this fusion has been affecting things in the outside world, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.81,0:37:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all rather worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.31,0:37:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We just wonder what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.57,0:37:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But, why man? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.07,0:37:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon doing some investigating, we uncovered a very significant fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.86,0:37:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Our two worlds connected,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.41,0:37:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and this fused space was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.91,0:37:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result, a fork in the space-time continuum appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.87,0:37:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A fork in the space-time continuum?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.71,0:37:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.67,0:37:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A fork path in the flow of time was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.71,0:38:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You've broken from the path in the flow of time you were supposed to follow,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.88,0:38:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and entered a different flow altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.76,0:38:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now new forks keep appearing,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.81,0:38:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and this space encounters new branches each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.64,0:38:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We've also discovered it's possible to jump to other parts of the path.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.10,0:38:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.94,0:38:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean we'll keep getting sent to other strange worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.03,0:38:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.15,0:38:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll run into the next brance after three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.07,0:38:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've calculated the next one after that
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.70,0:38:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,will be 100 million years from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.33,0:38:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That long?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.75,0:38:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even begin to image what that'd be like-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.96,0:38:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So our original worlds will only continue to get farther away...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.42,0:38:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll never be able to return to our original worlds and see the people from them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.34,0:38:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But my friends and family aren't here...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.14,0:38:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fans who cheer us on...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.85,0:38:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, is there anything we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.48,0:38:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is merely conjecture,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.15,0:39:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but if we were somehow able to jump back to the first point of divergence
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.86,0:39:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it may be possible for us to return to the original timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.61,0:39:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.12,0:39:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That I cannot say for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.54,0:39:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the power which creates and sustains this space
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.46,0:39:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,is idols' radiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.00,0:39:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If we were to be able to combine that radiance, we could bring about a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.30,0:39:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol's...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.59,0:39:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,radiance...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.80,0:39:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do we combine it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.72,0:39:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.47,0:39:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easy-peasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.60,0:39:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We just gotta put on a buncha shows!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.73,0:39:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ya think we'd shine really bright then?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.56,0:39:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.64,0:39:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.02,0:39:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to perform more anyways!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.57,0:39:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If we recruit our friends and sing the songs we like,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.53,0:39:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a lot we can sing-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.53,0:39:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hyped!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.32,0:39:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's only fair if Reona and I go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.24,0:39:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.87,0:39:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us sing with you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.50,0:39:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.62,0:39:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get hyped to the max!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.88,0:40:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.80,0:40:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultra maxxed!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.72,0:40:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody! We're gonna get everything back to normal in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.48,0:40:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You and me and a happy smiling shining happy train
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.98,0:40:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, mega lucky super sparkly lucky train
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.86,0:40:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Adventure's just around the corner
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.95,0:40:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,oh, my lucky tain!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.33,0:40:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Cinderella, and the clock's struck midnight
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.33,0:40:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,(too bad(
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.46,0:40:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You want everyone to remember
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.25,0:40:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(let's dance!)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.96,0:40:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Bid yourself from that night "goodbye"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.47,0:40:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuz tomorrow's back to normal
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.77,0:40:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just an unpolished gem
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.69,0:41:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you just have to keep polishing yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.65,0:41:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Countless hours passing by
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.57,0:41:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's your super shiny, ultra sparkly lucky time
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.24,0:41:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a wish upon a shooting star before it passes you by
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.37,0:41:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can once again board that ultra cheerful happy train
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.75,0:41:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe sometimes you'll slip up
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.04,0:41:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but that might lead you to your treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.55,0:41:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my happy train
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.56,0:41:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart-pounding and thrilling -- oh my lucky train!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.60,0:41:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A small wormhole has appeared in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.48,0:41:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,10-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.81,0:41:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep up that momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.71,0:42:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Madoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.84,0:42:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.13,0:42:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a step forward and ring the bell of blessings
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.55,0:42:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and take a bite from this sweet, red apple
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.89,0:42:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,With just one bite,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.23,0:42:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you've already become our captive
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.56,0:42:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel there before me
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.94,0:42:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My soul
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.74,0:42:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,twinges with unsatiable thirst
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.54,0:42:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We call out your name
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.50,0:42:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and invite you somewhere beyond fate
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.38,0:42:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,where darkness and light intermix
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.17,0:42:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Reversible Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.09,0:42:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A moebius strip wrapped around your finger
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.60,0:43:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The captivating demon and the smiling angel
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.23,0:43:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume change!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.81,0:43:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The captivating demon and the smiling angel
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.94,0:43:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember we two maidens
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.57,0:43:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Reversible-Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.20,0:43:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A moebius strip wrapped around your finger
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.62,0:43:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear not
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.75,0:43:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and yield yourself to us
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.88,0:43:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Devil ＆ Angel;
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.65,0:43:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Worship we two maidens
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.07,0:44:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol's radiance;
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.54,0:44:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,for that, you need look no further than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.00,0:44:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart beats to the rhythm of this magic ornamentation
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.59,0:44:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and I come alive with joy
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.47,0:44:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Love and dates -- it's all so boring
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.35,0:44:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, too, I want to dance
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.57,0:44:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart comes alight like raging fire
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.45,0:44:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The ttrobbing passion in my heart has no end
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.54,0:44:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,May this flower rooted deep inside my heart come into bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.42,0:45:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll shine even brighter than ever before
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.39,0:45:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bloom just as beautifully with the fire lit inside of me
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.35,0:45:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the red passion flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.44,0:45:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The flowers of my dream bloom splendidly
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.52,0:45:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Should these flower petals ever wither,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.56,0:45:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll return as buds once again
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.19,0:45:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the red passion flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.86,0:45:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time we go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.27,0:45:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up: the Kansai team!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.78,0:46:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give'em a good show!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.36,0:46:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt, I beseech of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.78,0:46:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The cauldron of hell hath been opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.20,0:46:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning of the demons' night!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.04,0:46:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally our turn to sing and stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.18,0:46:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaarmageddon's show-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.81,0:46:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about all 6 of us sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.49,0:46:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Sekimageddon-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.95,0:46:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The unspoken words hiding inside your heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.58,0:46:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Set them free and raise your voice
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.88,0:47:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Be the brightest version of yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.38,0:47:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and take hold of all the things you love
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.18,0:47:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Winners and losers don't matter
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.26,0:47:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come let's join hands
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.14,0:47:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey jimp! The part's just getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.32,0:47:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Let's go, it's party time!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.78,0:47:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dance with 1,2,3! Into the future! We're together forever
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.86,0:47:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're never ever going to give up, we swear on that
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.33,0:47:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,LEt's sing "I'll do my best"! Tomorrow will be even brighter
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.54,0:47:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.71,0:47:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Muster up your courage and search for joy
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.17,0:47:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and take over PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.11,0:48:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,LEt's sing "I'll do my best"! Tomorrow will be even brighter
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.07,0:48:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Muster up your courage and search for joy
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.46,0:48:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and take over PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.58,0:48:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They've also produced radiance!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.21,0:48:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so close to a miracle-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.09,0:48:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The light faded...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.34,0:48:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The wormhole in the sky has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.10,0:48:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.22,0:48:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But why...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.47,0:48:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we'll need more power if we're going to move this space...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.27,0:48:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But can we even produce enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.73,0:48:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.61,0:48:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been performing day in and day out the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.61,0:48:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times is it gonna take before it's enough?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.32,0:48:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,After three days, it's gonna take 100 million years worth of power isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.33,0:48:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we even really bring about a miracle?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.74,0:48:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Will we ever be able to go back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.66,0:48:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.71,0:49:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We can make a miracle happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.96,0:49:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we can! No matter how much work it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.09,0:49:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.26,0:49:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with Laala! We can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.63,0:49:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we almost did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.18,0:49:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.56,0:49:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We were all just strangers who'd never met until yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.06,0:49:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is how we met!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.77,0:49:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And we've been doing so many wonderful shows!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.98,0:49:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, when I first met you, I was really surprised!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.36,0:49:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But when we ended up performing together, I had so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.61,0:49:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.07,0:49:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It really felt like the start of something new!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.87,0:49:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.45,0:49:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.04,0:49:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.51,0:49:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.14,0:50:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's sing together!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.60,0:50:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.73,0:50:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.28,0:50:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The pink checks and layers are simply stunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.53,0:50:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the Starlight Academy Marching Coord
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.49,0:50:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink Parade Coord
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.35,0:50:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in another world, the feeling stays the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.98,0:50:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The cute ribbons tie your memories together!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.57,0:50:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Twinkle Ribbon Cyalume Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.12,0:50:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to be like all those other girls you see
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.33,0:51:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're better off just being yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.92,0:51:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If you feel the spark in your heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.55,0:51:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,come search for your ideals
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.39,0:51:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single memory we've made,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.89,0:51:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll snap'em in half
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.65,0:51:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and complete the set with our friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.32,0:51:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it! Once you get started, you're invicible!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.49,0:51:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Make up! Headed towards a radiant future
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.66,0:51:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Making Drama, switch on!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.46,0:51:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That dream's not just a dream anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.04,0:51:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.30,0:52:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone can be anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.01,0:52:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can walk the runway!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.48,0:52:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing a song!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.15,0:52:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.70,0:52:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.28,0:52:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,MAke it! Giving up on that dream is just not in the cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.67,0:52:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Make up!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.59,0:52:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it! Once you get started, you're invicible!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.18,0:52:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Make up! Headed towards a radiant future
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.01,0:52:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream's not just a dream anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.31,0:52:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone can be anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.85,0:52:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara PriPara-dise
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.02,0:52:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala! Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.48,0:52:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.53,0:53:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about the show you just did really lifted our spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.16,0:53:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me believe we can pull off a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.54,0:53:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed! You're laser focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.37,0:53:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to give gathering the idols radiance another go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.17,0:53:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Laser focused?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.46,0:53:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I've been thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.34,0:53:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we've been doing all these thrown together performances, but what if instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.26,0:53:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,we prepared for one big, best of the best performance intsead?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.22,0:53:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All of together for the best performance ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.10,0:53:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying we should all work together for one big show-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.77,0:53:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds so fun-garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.90,0:53:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We could have the people who perform on stage and the people who support from the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.86,0:53:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be bringing all our radiance together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.15,0:53:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That certainly sounds like an idea worth trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.53,0:53:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll hold the show after three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.53,0:53:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise that's our last chance for another 100 million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.45,0:53:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But who should we choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.83,0:53:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously it's--
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.75,0:53:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.37,0:53:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't Laala and Akari be good choices?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.96,0:53:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.13,0:54:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They were the first of us to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.80,0:54:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.47,0:54:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Akari and Miss Laala will be the centers
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.18,0:54:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,in a brand new idol group!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.43,0:54:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's gotta be
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.39,0:54:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,the ones who had a smash hit concert! The super idols, Luminas!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.77,0:54:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And the team who emerged victorious at the Divine Idol Grand Prix: SoLaMi Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.57,0:54:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The new team will be made of these six members!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.57,0:54:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They're SoLaMi Luminas!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.20,0:54:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Garu!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.12,0:54:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch. Fine, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.37,0:54:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's support we must play, then I suppose we'll just have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.37,0:54:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So then what are the supporters supposed to do-garu?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.17,0:54:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.00,0:54:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We could create a new ultimate special appeal...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.17,0:54:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we can create a new Making Drama!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.72,0:54:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we work on it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.18,0:54:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A Making Drama and Special Appeal put together... I like the sound of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.47,0:54:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Special Making Drama Appeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.23,0:54:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha. That's a bit long.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.98,0:54:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How about Making Appeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.57,0:55:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.45,0:55:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kiriya was here, she'd say "isn't this chill?"
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.66,0:55:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If Ms. Ajimi was here, she'd say
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.20,0:55:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.79,0:55:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.96,0:55:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The six members of SoLaMi Luminas will prepare to take the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.54,0:55:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else should put forth maximum effort to support them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.71,0:55:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.42,0:55:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of us will work on putting together the best song for the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.51,0:55:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's get amped!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.43,0:55:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be doing everything we can to support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.39,0:55:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Stylish!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.93,0:55:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.14,0:55:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Collaboration!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.02,0:55:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.78,0:55:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there one more thing you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.95,0:55:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsubasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.95,0:55:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Cosmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.95,0:55:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The best performance deserves the best outfits, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.41,0:55:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got this cosmic covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.20,0:55:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala and her friends should be here any minute now!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.00,0:55:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to practicing with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.29,0:55:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.08,0:55:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.09,0:56:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.13,0:56:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.51,0:56:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.80,0:56:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.39,0:56:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going? Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.51,0:56:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's you, Laala?!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.56,0:56:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So you really are a primary schooler...
Comment: 0,0:56:13.18,0:56:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.35,0:56:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.31,0:56:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Mirei?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.19,0:56:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really that surprisng...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.82,0:56:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.53,0:56:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.79,0:56:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for having us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.00,0:56:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.88,0:56:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You good with doing our regular old training?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.88,0:56:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's totally okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.19,0:57:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu, ai-katsu, ai-katsu
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.40,0:57:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Their stamina is unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.20,0:57:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to have to work overtime if we want to catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.32,0:57:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna fall behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.37,0:57:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri! Para! Pri! Para!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.37,0:57:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.00,0:57:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.55,0:57:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.97,0:57:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock climbing...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.85,0:57:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is what the Starlight Academy students are doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.77,0:57:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,then it's no wonder their idol abilities are on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.56,0:57:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little longer! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.73,0:57:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.27,0:57:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pshuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.86,0:57:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Sophy got blown away!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.94,0:57:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The center of the universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.24,0:57:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kokone!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.91,0:57:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I think ya mean me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.83,0:57:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.41,0:58:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.71,0:58:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.00,0:58:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.42,0:58:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They just can't get their act together.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.67,0:58:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But despite that, we've been making good prgoress.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.26,0:58:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! This is looking to be one awesome Making Appeal!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.51,0:58:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's chock full of idols' radiance!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.51,0:58:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we sure we can pull this off?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.31,0:58:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We only have one chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.90,0:58:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite true.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.19,0:58:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If it doesn't end up being the best concert anyone's ever seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.15,0:58:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be a big failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.66,0:58:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hearing that gives me anxiety!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.24,0:58:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It still feels like something's missing...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.33,0:58:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but thwat...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.37,0:58:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Headmistress, we have a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.25,0:58:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever is the matter, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.33,0:58:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When we were meeting about the new song, I heard from MegaBro —
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.38,0:58:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"MegaBro"?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.17,0:58:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean Meganii?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.84,0:58:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.63,0:58:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I found out something that was totally shocking!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.63,0:58:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.56,0:59:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The next performance will be the last one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.39,0:59:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.56,0:59:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Er, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.23,0:59:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of our idols will return things to normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.15,0:59:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and the two worlds will separate.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.28,0:59:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be cut off from each other forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.66,0:59:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So after that, we won't be able to meet up any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.16,0:59:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.54,0:59:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,To make matters worse, all of our memories of this will disappear too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.12,0:59:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So we'll forget all about this wonderful meeting...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.29,0:59:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.42,0:59:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.09,0:59:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I should tell Oozora and the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.67,0:59:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope it doesn't make them hesitant to go on...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.84,0:59:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.72,0:59:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already told everyone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.60,0:59:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.31,0:59:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I had the opportunity to gether everyone earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.61,0:59:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So how did they take the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.78,0:59:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is their final performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.16,0:59:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not going to be able to do things together anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.62,0:59:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone was shocked at first, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.62,1:00:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't long before they shifted and said,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.45,1:00:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who decided that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.25,1:00:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If it'll take a miracle to turn our worlds back, then we'll just make another miracle so we can meet again!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.38,1:00:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made miracles before and we can do it again!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.13,1:00:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,"We'll give it our everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.59,1:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.10,1:00:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to place our faith in our radiance.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.01,1:00:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.93,1:00:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,we're idols!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.14,1:00:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We should place our hopes in them, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.48,1:00:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know those girls can bring about a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.44,1:00:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu! Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.36,1:00:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.78,1:00:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything here is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.20,1:00:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You could come here every day!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.37,1:00:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at all those animals!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.91,1:00:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri-Para! Pri-Para!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.58,1:00:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Laala. You're as lively as ever!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.96,1:00:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about being in idol in PriPara
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.47,1:01:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,increases my power by 100 times!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.18,1:01:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your idol aura's increased 100 times over, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.47,1:01:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of PriPara-pri!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.73,1:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're far too slow, my little cagebirds!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.48,1:01:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy moly!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.31,1:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the power of pickled plums-pri.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.94,1:01:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hologrammation!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.28,1:01:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We used the power of hologrammation to construct a 3000 meter rock wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.74,1:01:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.29,1:01:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.62,1:01:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.75,1:01:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first I've ever
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.96,1:01:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,climbed a rock wall this tall.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.84,1:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,PriPara is something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.55,1:01:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my winning idiot power!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.22,1:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,With the power of both effort and calculations, we can't be beat!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.68,1:01:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.35,1:01:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri-Para!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.11,1:01:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai-katsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.28,1:02:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.07,1:02:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I give up! I'm out of ideas!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.37,1:02:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then a change of pace is in order.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.70,1:02:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At times like this, it's best to get up and moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.04,1:02:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.67,1:02:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's so lovely!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.63,1:02:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,After that conversation, we all thought there must be some way we can pitch in!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.71,1:02:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We want the stage itself to be able to give off the brightest shine!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.05,1:02:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our aikatsu!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.06,1:02:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our way to say "we're all idols"!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.68,1:02:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like everyone's [whatever word I used before]
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.69,1:02:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,has come together!/united
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.27,1:02:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Excelente!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.32,1:02:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.53,1:02:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to pull ourselves together.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.87,1:02:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.29,1:02:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's climb together!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.91,1:02:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.05,1:03:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Each and every one of us shines in our own way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.89,1:03:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And when we bring all of our [word I used] together,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.60,1:03:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we'll put on the greatets show ever!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.77,1:03:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatcha guys lollygagging around for?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.40,1:03:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you all forgotten about the Making Appeal?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.86,1:03:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Has hell's banquet not started?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.91,1:03:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. Let's go wrap things up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.66,1:03:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.67,1:03:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally made it...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.09,1:03:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky looks stunning...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.18,1:03:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope everything works out tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.06,1:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't know until we try-pri.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.56,1:04:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All we can do is give it our all.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.82,1:04:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.53,1:04:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have fun and go all out!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.49,1:04:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.50,1:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.74,1:05:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We call it the "Star Paradise Coord".
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.08,1:05:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking forward to working with you, partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.91,1:05:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out there and show us the greatest show ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.21,1:05:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll cosmically be cheering for you from the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.25,1:05:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.30,1:05:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up at the sky and smile
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.97,1:06:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones who twinkle and shine,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.15,1:06:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,we're SoLaMi Luminas!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.37,1:06:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.13,1:06:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A surprise-pri?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.38,1:06:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.14,1:06:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This rocks!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.10,1:06:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.40,1:06:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have the best time ever, so let's get hyped!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.03,1:06:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When our two worlds met, I got to sing with you
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.53,1:07:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A miracle we found by chasing swinging notes
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.66,1:07:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our final, destined stage
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.54,1:07:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The impossible is now possible, and we're so excited
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.63,1:07:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Altogether now! Let's take a dive into this play!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.68,1:07:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me feel even more of your Appeal
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.81,1:07:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we share the same motivation to do our best!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.40,1:07:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Passing through us, connecting us, I'm so glad we can shine like this
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.82,1:07:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we're idols! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.82,1:07:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Singing the melody that was made when we met
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.87,1:07:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll bring our voices together, uniting our glimmer as one
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.54,1:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear the sound of our racing hearts?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.08,1:07:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nature and happy tuning is what makes the sound of life
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.75,1:07:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it well -- this lyric starts it all
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.83,1:07:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're making miracles on this very stage
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.59,1:07:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Our voices reached them!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.80,1:07:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all friends, we're all idols!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.34,1:07:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make this miracle happen-pri!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.22,1:07:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Our feelings...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.85,1:08:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We should share those with them!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.05,1:08:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Our defiant, inspiring steps
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.81,1:08:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at everyone's cards!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.98,1:08:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We should all work together! Allow us to join!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.56,1:08:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,One single step leads to infinite possibilities!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.14,1:08:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it your all and show how much you want it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.32,1:08:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,These are PriTickets
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.90,1:08:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and Aikatsu cards!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.82,1:08:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it your all and show how much you want it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.21,1:08:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,For an idol, this is just the symbol of a new meeting
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.63,1:08:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Never lose your faith in everyone's courage
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.92,1:08:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been making miracles since the moment they met
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.06,1:08:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and now they'll be shining at the brightest they've ever been in this finale!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.10,1:08:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,One day you'll find yourself casually humming this tune
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.69,1:08:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever forget the fun we had while we were together
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.57,1:09:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost time for the climax!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.49,1:09:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Get hyped to the max and go!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.79,1:09:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Singing the melody that was made when we met
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.50,1:09:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll bring our voices together, uniting our glimmer as one
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.66,1:09:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And the rhythm of our beating hearts comes together
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.75,1:09:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,With our smiles and happy tuning, let's create the best moment ever
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.79,1:09:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. These lyrics will last forver
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.67,1:09:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's sing this treasure
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.67,1:09:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, miracles are right within our grasp!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.72,1:09:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Making Appeal, switch on!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.32,1:09:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.61,1:09:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fans
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.49,1:09:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,coords
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.81,1:10:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.56,1:10:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,memories
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.90,1:10:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the future
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.70,1:10:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't be thankful enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.87,1:10:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The miraculous meeting!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.87,1:10:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol paradise for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.04,1:10:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.72,1:10:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,the idols' radiance!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.55,1:10:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Success! Your chance is starting!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.84,1:10:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Laala!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.55,1:10:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's snap!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.43,1:10:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't goodbye,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.23,1:10:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,it's just goodbye until next time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.94,1:10:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's snap!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.19,1:10:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we'll meet again,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.07,1:11:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.90,1:11:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.03,1:11:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already evening?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.57,1:11:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wans't I supposed to perform today?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.74,1:11:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.37,1:11:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.29,1:11:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't remember a thing...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.71,1:11:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.34,1:11:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.55,1:11:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.81,1:11:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's supposed to be a special show...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.43,1:11:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about-pri?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.19,1:11:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The show's been over for a while...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.44,1:11:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pri?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.75,1:11:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Comment: 0,1:11:59.75,1:12:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.38,1:12:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't goodbye,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.18,1:12:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it's just goodbye until next time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.85,1:12:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we'll meet again,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.60,1:12:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.15,1:12:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,see you then!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.70,1:12:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again! It's a promise!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.70,1:12:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A message you'll remember even after 10,000 years;
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.37,1:12:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll share it with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.12,1:12:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My precious friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.79,1:12:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact we met means we were meant to be together
Comment: 0,1:12:47.13,1:12:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.68,1:12:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We can hear each other's songs
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.93,1:12:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,like we're singing in unison
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.15,1:13:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Place all of your goals into the cards and put your dreams into the ticket
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.36,1:13:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Carry friends
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.03,1:13:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again, but it feels like we won't have to wait
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.70,1:13:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,When do you want to meet next?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.41,1:13:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have so much fun
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.13,1:13:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be together forever
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.38,1:13:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wonderful story -- let's start something new
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.14,1:13:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Pa-Pa-Ra Make it, Now!\NDu-Du-Wa DO IT, Now!!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.93,1:13:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Singing is how we understand each other!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.64,1:13:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Our show will never end
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.73,1:13:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Pretty Activites will continue forever
Comment: 0,1:13:46.23,1:13:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.11,1:13:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Even just one second
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.32,1:13:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet each other wearing the best coord sever
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.76,1:14:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to stop compliment each other
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.52,1:14:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gone back to our homes, but we can never talk enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.94,1:14:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether the present
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.82,1:14:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to see what's coming
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.03,1:14:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,in the future
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.36,1:14:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,(Our Dream Stage!)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.12,1:14:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the same generation, so let it resonate
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.71,1:14:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(Our Dream Stage!)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.96,1:14:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a prism
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.84,1:14:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,shining is so many colors
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.89,1:14:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It might sometimes feel lonely
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.18,1:15:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but this promise is something we'll cherish
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.94,1:15:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So now when your heart beats
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.87,1:15:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,look forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll share our thanks with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,For all the time we've walked together side-by-side
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The amount of wonderful stories we have will continue growing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Special Appeal! Making Drama!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep having miraculous meetings!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll shine forever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,in our idol paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our pretty activities will never end!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
